<title>UK: UK M0 grows provisional 7.4 pct in year to Jan.</title>
<headline>UK M0 grows provisional 7.4 pct in year to Jan.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-02-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Bank of England released the following provisional data on M0 money supply -</p>
<p>    MONEY SUPPLY (in pct)	   Jan		  Dec</p>
<p>    M0 in month (adjusted)	  0.7		  0.7</p>
<p>    M0 annual (adjusted)	    7.4		  7.0</p>
<p>    M0 in month (unadjusted) -6.2	    6.2</p>
<p>    M0 annual (unadjusted)	  5.9		  6.6</p>
<p>NOTE - consensus forecast 7.4 pct yr/yr s/adj growth.</p>
</text>
